{"hw":"ἀριστάω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἀριστάω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀριστάω</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">inf.</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἀριστᾶν,</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Ion.</span> </span> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <span class=\"gk\">-ῆν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hp.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Vict.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.68</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\">pf.</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἠρίστηκα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cyr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.2.39</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Antiph.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">212.25</span> </span>; of this tense the Com. also used I pl. <span class=\"gk\">ἠρίσταμεν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Fr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">496</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Theopomp.Com.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">22</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">inf.</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἠριστάναι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hermipp.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">60</span> </span>:— <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">pf.</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἠρίστημαι,</span> <abbr>v.</abbr> infr. [<span class=\"gk\">αρ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Eq.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">815</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">αρ</span> only late, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">AP</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">11.387</span> </span> (<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pall.</span> </span>)]:—<b class=\"lex-tr\">take the</b> <span class=\"gk\">ἄριστον</span> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">midday meal,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Nu.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">416</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Eq.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">815</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἠρίστων,</span> opp. <span class=\"gk\">ἐδείπνουν,</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Mem.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.7.12</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">An.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.6.21</span> </span>: c. acc. rei, <b class=\"lex-tr\">breakfast on,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ἴα καὶ ῥόδα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Diod.Com.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.37</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pherecr.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">122.5</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\">pf.</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span> impers., <span class=\"gk\">ἠρίστηται δ' ἐξαρκούντως</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ra.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">377</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">eat a second meal,</b> opp. <span class=\"gk\">μονοσιτέω,</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hp.</span> </span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">V M</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">10</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Acut.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">30</span> </span>.</div></div>"}